WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000

STYLE
::cue(.italic) { font-style:italic }

232
00:10:55.489 --> 00:11:00.027 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
向上划，放下。还剩两次，你能行。

233
00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:04.398 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
缓慢、稳定地完成，保持控制和专注。

234
00:11:04.765 --> 00:11:06.900 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
来，向后拉，发力都在身体后侧。

235
00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:09.736 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
二、一，站直。［欢呼］

236
00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:14.241 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
拿起第二只哑铃，回到原地弓步蹲。

237
00:11:14.775 --> 00:11:16.443 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
肩膀向后下方收好。

238
00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:19.913 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
收紧核心，左脚后撤。

239
00:11:20.347 --> 00:11:21.348 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
双膝弯曲，

240
00:11:21.448 --> 00:11:23.650 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
左膝朝地面方向下降，

241
00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:25.719 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
再起身站直。

242
00:11:25.886 --> 00:11:28.355 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
选择适合自己的动作幅度。来吧！

243
00:11:28.488 --> 00:11:32.159 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
向下，起身时右脚有力蹬地，

244
00:11:32.359 --> 00:11:35.062 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
下降时也要认真控制。

245
00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:40.033 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
下降时应该感受到挑战。

246
00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:43.203 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
对我来说，起身会稍微好受一点。

247
00:11:44.238 --> 00:11:45.839 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
勇敢迎接这种挑战。［欢呼］

248
00:11:46.139 --> 00:11:48.041 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
下降时也全力投入。

249
00:11:48.442 --> 00:11:50.143 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
［用力声］最后一次。

250
00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:51.845 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
［教练们］“你得认真练。”

251
00:11:51.979 --> 00:11:55.148 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
没错！站直，换边。

252
00:11:55.449 --> 00:11:56.950 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
右脚后撤。［欢呼］

253
00:11:57.484 --> 00:12:02.756 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
二、一，右膝向下。

